      "a071_finding": 5,
      "a071_severity": "high",
      "decision": "approve",
      "location": "crates/oo-builder/src/nfc.rs; unicode-normalization 0.1.25 tables UNICODE_VERSION (17, 0, 0)",
      "summary": "Thirty-four Unicode 17 marks are unassigned in Unicode 16 and have a non-zero class in Unicode 17. U+1ACF is class 230. e U+1ACF U+0323 becomes U+1EB9 U+1ACF. Twenty-nine class-230 marks and U+1AEB (class 234) compose the same way. U+1ADD, U+1AE6, U+10EFA, and U+10EFB are class 220, equal to U+0323, and stay in source order. The fetched crate constant is (17, 0, 0). Unicode 16 leaves e U+1ACF U+0323 unchanged.",
